  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Democracy Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen digital resilience, safeguard electoral integrity, and empower young citizens to participate meaningfully in Nepal&#x2019;s democratic processes. It will do so through a multi-pronged approach supporting Election Commission Nepal for the following objectives:
1.	To counter digital information disorder and safeguard electoral integrity in Nepal.
2.	To improve public access to accurate, inclusive, and easy-to-understand electoral information in online spaces in Nepal
3.	To create inclusive digital and data-informed spaces for meaningful youth participation through informed dialogue and engagement</narrative>
  </description>
